{
  "schema": "house/1",
  "id": "long-roof",
  "name": { "cs": "Dům Dlouhá střecha", "en": "Long Roof House" },
  "idea": {
    "cs": "Jedna klidná podélná valba s\u00a0příčnou vstupní valbou. Garáž stojí v\u00a0severozápadním rohu, krytá terasa je vtažená do jihozápadního rohu mezi sloupy. Obytný prostor leží uprostřed domu a\u00a0velkou posuvnou stěnou se otevírá do zahrady, vstup vede přes halu se šatnou a\u00a0noční část má vlastní chodbu.",
    "en": "One calm, elongated hip roof with a transverse entrance hip. The garage sits in the north-west corner and the covered terrace is recessed into the south-west corner between columns. The living space lies in the middle of the house and opens to the garden through a large sliding wall; the entrance leads through a hall with a cloakroom, and the night wing has its own corridor."
  },
